@guide H_42_SwampofSorrows
@name Swamp of Sorrows (48-49)
@faction Horde
@levels 48-49
@zone Swamp of Sorrows
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Swamp of Sorrows, visit 2 of 2 on the Horde route, levels 48-49.
@next H_43_DustwallowMarsh

fly Stonard | Take the flight from Thorium Point.
travel Swamp of Sorrows
train
accept 1422 Threat From the Sea
turnin 1422 Threat From the Sea | Katar, next to Tok'Kar.
accept 1426 Threat From the Sea
complete 1426 Threat From the Sea | Marsh Murlocs, Inkspewers and Flesheaters on the beach south of Katar.
turnin 1426 Threat From the Sea
accept 1427 Threat From the Sea
turnin 1427 Threat From the Sea | Tok'Kar.
accept 1428 Continued Threat [optional] | Katar. Needs level 41; skipped if you are lower.
complete 1428 Continued Threat [optional] | Marsh Inkspewers, Flesheaters and Oracles on the same beach.
turnin 1428 Continued Threat [optional]
accept 2784 Fall From Grace
complete 2784 Fall From Grace
turnin 2784 Fall From Grace
accept 2621 The Disgraced One
turnin 2621 The Disgraced One
accept 2622 The Missing Orders
turnin 2622 The Missing Orders
accept 2623 The Swamp Talker
complete 2623 The Swamp Talker
turnin 2623 The Swamp Talker
accept 2801 A Tale of Sorrow
complete 2801 A Tale of Sorrow
turnin 2801 A Tale of Sorrow
level 49 | Dustwallow Marsh starts at 49. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
